{
  "name": "Shopify Morning Check (free)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5424b4d5-d264-4d60-a82c-7666f0ac9eb6",
      "name": "Every morning at 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "7528a851-1bdb-48e1-a9af-097623b7b57a",
              "name": "shop_domain",
              "value": "your-store.myshopify.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b5a1c8db-ef95-44eb-ad0e-32e078aca02f",
              "name": "email_to",
              "value": "you@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "17fe5fb9-db5d-4f05-ae04-3aa2b10bbfff",
              "name": "stuck_after_hours",
              "value": 48,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "fa200442-ffab-4eb1-a594-3b6350495c44",
              "name": "low_stock_threshold",
              "value": 5,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "e0708ad1-c14b-49ae-a907-07b35320a49c",
              "name": "api_version",
              "value": "2026-07",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3cace20-b011-4efe-a591-c76801389d22",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ (/^https?:\\/\\//.test($('Config').item.json.shop_domain) ? $('Config').item.json.shop_domain : 'https://' + $('Config').item.json.shop_domain).replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/admin/oauth/access_token",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "client_credentials"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "628d30b6-aca4-4fcf-aafa-229ea6ea30b5",
      "name": "Get Shopify access token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ (/^https?:\\/\\//.test($('Config').item.json.shop_domain) ? $('Config').item.json.shop_domain : 'https://' + $('Config').item.json.shop_domain).replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/admin/api/{{ $('Config').item.json.api_version }}/graphql.json",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Shopify-Access-Token",
              "value": "={{ $('Get Shopify access token').item.json.access_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: \"query($q: String!) { shop { name myshopifyDomain currencyCode } orders(first: 100, query: $q, sortKey: CREATED_AT) { nodes { id name createdAt displayFulfillmentStatus totalPriceSet { shopMoney { amount } } } } }\", variables: { q: \"financial_status:paid AND status:open AND (fulfillment_status:unshipped OR fulfillment_status:partial) AND created_at:<'\" + $now.minus({ hours: Number($('Config').item.json.stuck_after_hours) }).toUTC().toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true }) + \"'\" } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "b70dd177-4bfa-4f08-a0f6-62f0dde5148d",
      "name": "Get stuck orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ (/^https?:\\/\\//.test($('Config').item.json.shop_domain) ? $('Config').item.json.shop_domain : 'https://' + $('Config').item.json.shop_domain).replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/admin/api/{{ $('Config').item.json.api_version }}/graphql.json",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Shopify-Access-Token",
              "value": "={{ $('Get Shopify access token').item.json.access_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: \"query($q: String!) { productVariants(first: 100, query: $q) { nodes { id title inventoryQuantity inventoryItem { tracked } product { title status } } } }\", variables: { q: 'inventory_quantity:<=' + Number($('Config').item.json.low_stock_threshold) } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "7f9d263b-abd8-41f7-a9ef-72b236a1832c",
      "name": "Get low-stock variants",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "err",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!($('Get stuck orders').item.json.errors || $json.errors) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "71f57ea5-9106-44d1-ad92-bf49ecb006ef",
      "name": "Shopify error?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "={{ 'Shopify API error: ' + JSON.stringify($('Get stuck orders').item.json.errors || $json.errors).slice(0, 400) + ' (check the app scopes: read_orders, read_products, read_inventory)' }}"
      },
      "id": "73fc7f3c-aa82-4e10-a207-8c0ffad7eeb6",
      "name": "Stop: Shopify error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5bfc9159-6c93-4a29-a302-b13326bd6e4b",
              "name": "shop_name",
              "value": "={{ $('Get stuck orders').item.json.data.shop.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4b58800b-493f-464f-aab1-81f86428bbd5",
              "name": "admin_url",
              "value": "={{ 'https://admin.shopify.com/store/' + $('Get stuck orders').item.json.data.shop.myshopifyDomain.replace('.myshopify.com', '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a65255c3-dddf-4659-ac66-2f282326415f",
              "name": "stuck_orders",
              "value": "={{ $('Get stuck orders').item.json.data.orders.nodes.map(o => ({\n  name: o.name,\n  id: o.id.split('/').pop(),\n  status: o.displayFulfillmentStatus === 'PARTIALLY_FULFILLED' ? 'Partly shipped' : 'Not shipped',\n  waiting_hours: Math.floor(($now.toMillis() - new Date(o.createdAt).getTime()) / 3600000),\n  total: new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: $('Get stuck orders').item.json.data.shop.currencyCode }).format(Number(o.totalPriceSet.shopMoney.amount)),\n})).sort((a, b) => b.waiting_hours - a.waiting_hours) }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "1dc3fcf2-2454-417c-a193-12e3efbcb25a",
              "name": "low_stock",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.productVariants.nodes\n  .filter(v => v.inventoryItem.tracked && v.product.status === 'ACTIVE' && v.inventoryQuantity > 0)\n  .map(v => ({ product: v.product.title, variant: v.title === 'Default Title' ? '' : v.title, on_hand: v.inventoryQuantity }))\n  .sort((a, b) => a.on_hand - b.on_hand) }}",
              "type": "array"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e07e78e7-ab7a-48a0-aaa5-bc532fc2814e",
      "name": "Build the report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1320,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "n",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.stuck_orders.length + $json.low_stock.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f046aae8-16cb-4b16-acc8-14ccb219af20",
      "name": "Anything to report?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f6f6f4;padding:24px 12px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6b6b6b\">{{ $json.shop_name }} · Morning Check</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size:15px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:18px 0 6px\">Paid but not shipped after {{ $('Config').item.json.stuck_after_hours }}h ({{ $json.stuck_orders.length }})</h3>\n{{ $json.stuck_orders.length ? '<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px\">' + $json.stuck_orders.map(o => '<tr><td style=\"padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\"><a href=\"' + $json.admin_url + '/orders/' + o.id + '\" style=\"color:#1a1a1a\">' + o.name + '</a></td><td style=\"text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\">' + o.status + '</td><td style=\"text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\">' + (o.waiting_hours >= 48 ? Math.floor(o.waiting_hours / 24) + ' days' : o.waiting_hours + ' h') + '</td><td style=\"text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\">' + o.total + '</td></tr>').join('') + '</table>' : '<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#067647\">Nothing waiting. Every paid order has shipped.</p>' }}\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size:15px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:18px 0 6px\">Stock at or below {{ $('Config').item.json.low_stock_threshold }} units ({{ $json.low_stock.length }})</h3>\n{{ $json.low_stock.length ? '<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px\">' + $json.low_stock.map(v => '<tr><td style=\"padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\">' + v.product + (v.variant ? ' <span style=\"color:#6b6b6b\">· ' + v.variant + '</span>' : '') + '</td><td style=\"text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e6e6\">' + v.on_hand + '</td></tr>').join('') + '</table>' : '<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#067647\">No tracked variant is running low.</p>' }}\n\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#6b6b6b;margin-top:18px\">Active products with tracked inventory only. Change the thresholds in the Config node.</p>\n</div></div>"
      },
      "id": "d678dd71-bb56-4bf9-a7c3-120e1749ada2",
      "name": "Email template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.html",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Config').item.json.email_to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $('Build the report').item.json.shop_name + ': ' + [ $('Build the report').item.json.stuck_orders.length ? $('Build the report').item.json.stuck_orders.length + ' unshipped orders' : '', $('Build the report').item.json.low_stock.length ? $('Build the report').item.json.low_stock.length + ' low-stock variants' : '' ].filter(Boolean).join(', ') }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.html }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "331bff4a-44ac-4dfb-ad41-0d15a7534340",
      "name": "Send email (Gmail)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1980,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "1bb2956e-ea75-4889-af07-c30690dd525e",
      "name": "All clear, no email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shopify Morning Check\n\nEvery morning at 7:00 you get one email with the paid orders that still haven't shipped and the product variants that are running low, so you can fix them before customers start asking \"where is my order?\". Quiet mornings send nothing.\n\n## How it works\n1. **Every morning at 7** starts the run and **Config** holds your settings.\n2. **Get Shopify access token** asks Shopify for a fresh Admin API token (Dev Dashboard apps use the client-credentials grant; tokens expire after 24h).\n3. **Get stuck orders** and **Get low-stock variants** query the Admin GraphQL API.\n4. **Build the report** keeps tracked, active, in-stock variants and computes how long each order has waited.\n5. **Anything to report?** skips the email on quiet days; otherwise **Email template** builds the HTML and Gmail sends it.\n\n## Setup steps\n1. In the Shopify Dev Dashboard, create an app with the scopes `read_orders,read_products,read_inventory`, uncheck \"Embed app in Shopify admin\" and install it on your store.\n2. In **Get Shopify access token**, create a Custom Auth credential: `{\"body\":{\"client_id\":\"YOUR_ID\",\"client_secret\":\"YOUR_SECRET\"}}`\n3. In **Config**, set `shop_domain` (the .myshopify.com address) and `email_to`.\n4. Connect Gmail, click Execute workflow to test, then publish.\n\n## Customize\nChange `stuck_after_hours` and `low_stock_threshold` in **Config**, or swap Gmail for Slack, Outlook or SMTP.\n\n_QuietOps · quiet automations for busy businesses_",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "a3514e43-b0b7-426d-a97e-b58679e3a56c",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Fresh token every run\nThe token request is sent as **JSON**, so n8n merges the Custom Auth credential's client_id and client_secret into it. With form-urlencoded it would silently drop them.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fe5c3e81-b61b-4f48-af81-17ee772fc668",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Read the store\nTwo GraphQL calls with retry on failure. Only `read_*` scopes, no customer data (customer names would need the protected `read_customers` scope). Each call returns up to 100 results.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d73df4ad-9420-474c-a9ce-551567b6d467",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Shape and send\nIf Shopify returns an error the run stops with a clear message. Otherwise the report is built, empty days are skipped, and the email links every order to your Shopify admin.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ee803a54-fc0e-4aa9-a8e2-0e4a2c70bdf3",
      "name": "Note 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1280,
        620
      ]
    }
  ],
